sequenceDiagram
    participant FS as Field Staff
    participant MOBILE as Mobile App
    participant LOCAL_DB as Local Storage
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant SYNC as Sync Service
    participant WS as Workflow Service
    participant FS_SVC as File Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant CACHE as Redis Cache
    
    Note over FS,CACHE: Mobile App Synchronization Workflow
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Open mobile app
    MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Check last sync timestamp
    LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Return last sync: 2024-01-01 10:30:00
    
    MOBILE->>MOBILE: Check network connectivity
    
    alt Network Available
        MOBILE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
        API-->>MOBILE: Return JWT token
        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Store authentication token
        
        MOBILE->>API: GET /api/v1/mobile/sync/facilities?since=2024-01-01T10:30:00Z
        API->>SYNC: Process facility sync request
        SYNC->>WS: Get facilities assigned to user since timestamp
        
        WS->>DB: Query facility assignments and updates
        Note over WS,DB: Query includes: new assignments, status changes, facility updates
        DB-->>WS: Return facility changes
        
        WS->>CACHE: Check for cached facility data
        alt Cache Hit
            CACHE-->>WS: Return cached data
        else Cache Miss
            WS->>DB: Fetch complete facility details
            DB-->>WS: Return facility data
            WS->>CACHE: Update cache
        end
        
        WS-->>SYNC: Return facility sync data
        SYNC-->>API: Return sync response
        API-->>MOBILE: Download facility updates
        
        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Begin local transaction
        
        loop For each facility update
            alt New Facility Assignment
                MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Insert new facility record
                MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Download activity form templates
                LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Facility and templates stored
                
            else Facility Status Change
                MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Update facility status
                LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Status updated
                
                alt Status Changed to ACTIVE
                    MOBILE->>MOBILE: Show notification "New facility available"
                else Status Changed to COMPLETED
                    MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Mark local data as read-only
                    LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Data marked read-only
                end
                
            else Facility Data Update
                MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Update facility information
                LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Information updated
            end
        end
        
        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Commit local transaction
        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Update last sync timestamp
        LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Sync timestamp updated
        
        Note over MOBILE,CACHE: Upload Pending Local Changes
        
        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Get pending uploads (reports, photos)
        LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Return unsynchronized data
        
        loop For each pending report
            MOBILE->>MOBILE: Prepare upload data (report + attachments)
            
            MOBILE->>API: POST /api/v1/activity-reports (multipart)
            API->>WS: Process report submission
            
            WS->>FS_SVC: Process file uploads
            FS_SVC->>FS_SVC: Validate and store files
            FS_SVC-->>WS: Return file URLs
            
            WS->>DB: Begin transaction
            WS->>DB: Create activity_reports record
            WS->>DB: Update facility_activities status
            DB-->>WS: Report saved
            WS->>DB: Commit transaction
            
            WS-->>API: Report uploaded successfully
            API-->>MOBILE: Return success response
            
            MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Mark report as synchronized
            MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Delete local files (keep metadata)
            LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Local cleanup completed
        end
        
        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Get pending progress updates
        LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Return auto-saved progress
        
        loop For each progress update
            MOBILE->>API: POST /api/v1/facility-activities/{id}/progress
            API->>WS: Update progress
            WS->>DB: Store progress snapshot
            DB-->>WS: Progress saved
            WS-->>API: Progress updated
            API-->>MOBILE: Progress synchronized
            
            MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Mark progress as synchronized
            LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Progress update cleared
        end
        
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Sync completed successfully"
        
    else Network Unavailable (Offline Mode)
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Working offline"
        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Enable offline mode
        LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Offline mode enabled
        
        Note over MOBILE,LOCAL_DB: Continue working with cached data
    end
    
    Note over FS,CACHE: Offline Data Collection
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Select facility to work on
    MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Load facility and form template
    LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Return facility data and form
    MOBILE-->>FS: Display activity form
    
    loop Data Collection (Offline)
        FS->>MOBILE: Fill form fields
        FS->>MOBILE: Take photos/videos
        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Auto-save progress locally
        LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Progress saved
        
        alt Network Becomes Available
            MOBILE->>API: POST /api/v1/facility-activities/{id}/auto-save
            API->>WS: Save progress to server
            WS->>DB: Store progress snapshot
            DB-->>WS: Progress saved remotely
            WS-->>API: Return save confirmation
            API-->>MOBILE: Show "Progress backed up"
            
            MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Mark progress as synchronized
            LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Sync status updated
        end
    end
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Complete and submit report
    MOBILE->>MOBILE: Validate form completion
    
    alt Form Validation Failed
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show validation errors
        FS->>MOBILE: Fix errors and retry
        
    else Form Valid
        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Store completed report with "PENDING_UPLOAD" status
        LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Report queued for upload
        
        alt Network Available
            MOBILE->>MOBILE: Immediate upload attempt
            MOBILE->>API: POST /api/v1/activity-reports (multipart)
            
            alt Upload Successful
                API-->>MOBILE: Report uploaded successfully
                MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Mark report as synchronized
                MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Report submitted successfully"
                
            else Upload Failed
                MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Keep report in pending queue
                MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Report saved, will upload when online"
            end
            
        else Network Unavailable
            MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Report saved, will upload when online"
        end
    end
    
    Note over FS,CACHE: Background Sync Process
    
    MOBILE->>MOBILE: Start background sync service
    Note over MOBILE: Runs every 5 minutes when online
    
    loop Background Sync Cycle
        MOBILE->>MOBILE: Check network connectivity
        
        alt Network Available
            MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Check for pending uploads
            LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Return pending items
            
            alt Has Pending Uploads
                MOBILE->>MOBILE: Process uploads silently
                
                loop For each pending item
                    MOBILE->>API: Upload pending data
                    
                    alt Upload Successful
                        API-->>MOBILE: Success response
                        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Mark as synchronized
                        MOBILE->>MOBILE: Show subtle success indicator
                        
                    else Upload Failed
                        MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Increment retry count
                        alt Max Retries Reached
                            MOBILE->>MOBILE: Flag for manual attention
                            MOBILE->>MOBILE: Show "Upload failed, manual sync needed"
                        end
                    end
                end
                
            else No Pending Uploads
                MOBILE->>API: Check for new assignments/updates
                API->>SYNC: Quick sync check
                SYNC->>DB: Check for updates since last sync
                
                alt Updates Available
                    DB-->>SYNC: Return update summary
                    SYNC-->>API: Return sync needed flag
                    API-->>MOBILE: Show "Updates available"
                    MOBILE->>MOBILE: Show sync notification to user
                    
                else No Updates
                    SYNC-->>API: No updates
                    API-->>MOBILE: No sync needed
                end
            end
            
        else Network Unavailable
            Note over MOBILE: Continue offline, retry later
        end
        
        MOBILE->>MOBILE: Wait 5 minutes for next cycle
    end
    
    Note over FS,CACHE: Manual Full Sync
    
    FS->>MOBILE: Pull to refresh or click sync button
    MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Syncing..."
    
    MOBILE->>API: POST /api/v1/mobile/sync/full
    API->>SYNC: Full synchronization request
    
    SYNC->>WS: Get complete user context
    WS->>DB: Query all user assignments and recent updates
    DB-->>WS: Return comprehensive sync data
    
    SYNC->>FS_SVC: Get required form templates and assets
    FS_SVC-->>SYNC: Return template versions
    
    SYNC-->>API: Return full sync package
    API-->>MOBILE: Download complete sync data
    
    MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Begin full sync transaction
    MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Clear outdated cached data
    MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Update all facility assignments
    MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Update form templates
    MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Update user profile and permissions
    LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Full sync completed
    
    MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Commit sync transaction
    MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Update last full sync timestamp
    LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Full sync finalized
    
    MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Sync completed"
    
    Note over FS,CACHE: Conflict Resolution
    
    alt Data Conflict Detected
        MOBILE->>MOBILE: Detect server vs local data conflict
        MOBILE-->>FS: Show "Data conflict detected"
        
        FS->>MOBILE: Choose resolution strategy
        alt Keep Server Data
            MOBILE->>LOCAL_DB: Replace local data with server data
            LOCAL_DB-->>MOBILE: Local data updated
            
        else Keep Local Data
            MOBILE->>API: Force upload local changes
            API->>SYNC: Process conflict override
            SYNC->>DB: Update server with local data (with conflict flag)
            DB-->>SYNC: Conflict resolution recorded
            SYNC-->>API: Conflict resolved
            API-->>MOBILE: Local data preserved
            
        else Manual Merge
            MOBILE-->>FS: Show merge interface
            FS->>MOBILE: Manually resolve conflicts
            MOBILE->>API: Upload merged data
            API-->>MOBILE: Merged data saved
        end
    end
    
    Note over FS,CACHE: Sync completed with offline capability maintained 